cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ReflexGrid or its Excel compatibility report, please cite it as below."
title: ReflexGrid
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open-source, self-hosted online Excel: a browser spreadsheet that opens and saves real .xlsx
  and .xlsm workbooks, runs their Excel VBA macros and UserForms, and lets several people edit the
  same workbook live. Its engine, gridcore, is pure Python. The Excel compatibility report,
  written by the test run of each change, is at
  https://milochen0418.github.io/reflex_grid/compatibility.html
authors:
  - given-names: Milo
    family-names: Chen
repository-code: "https://github.com/milochen0418/reflex_grid"
url: "https://milochen0418.github.io/reflex_grid/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
keywords:
  - spreadsheet
  - excel
  - xlsx
  - xlsm
  - vba
  - userforms
  - collaborative editing
  - python
